<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Feral Druid DPS Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46161/conquerors-nightsong-headguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Nightsong Headguard</span></a> is the 25-man version (Item Level 232) of the Tier 8 helm for Feral Druids, and will be your BiS helm option in Phase 2 of WotLK. Individually, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45993/mimirons-flight-goggles">
