<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Feral Druid DPS Phase 2</h3>Similar to the cloak slot, the best Phase 2 bracers in isolation, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45611/solar-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solar Bindings</span></a>, cannot be accommodated in a fully optimized gear set without exceeding the Expertise cap, so <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45869/fluxing-energy-coils">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fluxing Energy Coils</span></a> will provide higher DPS in practice due to their lack of Expertise Rating.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57683/fur-lining-attack-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Attack Power</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>.<br/>If you are not a Leatherworker, then the best alternative bracer enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44575/enchant-bracers-greater-assault">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Greater Assault</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
