<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Feral Druid DPS Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46158/conquerors-nightsong-handgrips">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Nightsong Handgrips</span></a> are the best Tier 8 piece to pair with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46161/conquerors-nightsong-headguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Nightsong Headguard</span></a> for activating the 2-piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-76/conquerors-nightsong-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Nightsong Battlegear</span></a> set bonus. This is because there are no Item Level 252 off-piece options in the glove slot, and the strongest off-pieces that do exist, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46043/gloves-of-the-endless-dark">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_54.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Endless Dark</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45325/gloves-of-the-stonereaper">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Stonereaper</span></a>, eat up valuable Hit budget despite being individually better than the Tier 8 gloves.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>.<br/>If you are not an Engineer, then the best alternative glove enchants are <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44488/enchant-gloves-precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_greaterheal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Precision</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60668/enchant-gloves-crusher">
