<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Idols for Feral Druid DPS Phase 2</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-feral-druid-dps-phase-2">Weapons for Feral Druid DPS Phase 2</h4>For Phase 2 gearing, your best weapon option for Feral DPS will be the 252 Item Level staff <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45613/dreambinder">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreambinder</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=32871/algalon-the-observer">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Algalon the Observer</span></a>. However, for <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>
<span class="q10">Horde</span> players (or <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<span class="q3">Alliance</span> players without a <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="race" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/draenei">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_draenei_male.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draenei</span></a> in their party), the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=33288/yogg-saron">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Yogg-Saron</span></a> polearm <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45533/dark-edge-of-depravity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_halberd_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Edge of Depravity</span></a> is only very slightly worse, provided that you itemize the rest of your gear set around its high Hit Rating allocation. Keep in mind that Feral Druids scale better with weapon upgrades than any other DPS spec in the game due to the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=16975/predatory-strikes">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_pet_cat.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Predatory Strikes</span></a> talent, so any reasonable loot council should give you early priority on one of these two weapons, since both of them will provide around an <b>800 DPS boost</b> relative to the Phase 1 BiS weapon <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40388/journeys-end">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_89.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Journey's End</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Berserking</span></a>
<br/>Note that <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60691/enchant-2h-weapon-massacre">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant 2H Weapon - Massacre</span></a> is only very slightly worse for average DPS value, so it is the preferred enchant for weapons that you will also be using while tanking.<div class="pad"></div>
